# 云端入口（030 research R3、R4、R19）：LoadBalancer + HTTPS 监听器 + HTTP 重定向；负载均衡器注解在 values/cloud-lb.yaml 中按云厂商维护
envoyService:
  type: LoadBalancer
loadBalancer:
  annotations:
{{- readFile "../values/cloud-lb.yaml" | fromYaml | toYaml | nindent 4 }}
nodeSelector:
  {{ .Values.nodeLabel }}: {{ .Values.nodePool | quote }}
https:
  enabled: true
  certificateSecret: contexture-tls
  redirectHttp: true
